WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:02.293
SPEAKER: You are
 the enemy of the people!

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:04.045
SPEAKER 2: Right through!
 It's coming through!

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:06.339
REPORTER: We are live
 on the air at the moment.

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:08.258
Do you mind telling me
why I am under arrest, sir?

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:12.595
REPORTER 2: That reporter was
just taken into police custody,

00:00:12.929 --> 00:00:14.973
live on television.

00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:17.100
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:20.019
CARL JUSTE: As journalists,
 we can't let the truth down.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.939
We are moderators of fact.

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:26.985
SPEAKER 3: Governments attacking
 journalists is not new.

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:28.194
Oh, look at all the fake news!

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:30.947
ALL: (CHANTING)
CNN sucks! CNN sucks!

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:32.991
This is happening widespread,
also.

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:38.496
The president of Brazil
is saying that I am a whore.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:39.873
SPEAKER 4: In the constitution,

00:00:39.956 --> 00:00:42.250
freedom of the press
is guaranteed,

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:45.879
but the rules are changing.

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:50.550
SPEAKER 5: The problem is
 the lack of public trust
 in journalism.

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:53.762
I'm not gonna buy a newspaper
that doesn't reflect my views.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.931
SPEAKER 6: It sometimes feels
 like when you talk to people,

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:58.641
you're living in
two different realities.

00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:01.436
If you want to talk to me,
you can take the mask off.

00:01:04.105 --> 00:01:05.398
SPEAKER 7:
You can never tell what threats

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:07.025
are gonna materialize
on the ground.

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:09.944
(SPEAKING IN SPANISH)

00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:16.868
JUSTE: In my 30 years
 of experience,

00:01:16.951 --> 00:01:19.245
I have not seen this amount
of harassment.

00:01:19.454 --> 00:01:21.748
It's not even harassment,
it's intimidation.

00:01:22.624 --> 00:01:25.084
It's so difficult to know
if this is the end of an era,

00:01:25.168 --> 00:01:28.171
or the beginning of
something even more sinister.

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.172
(CROWD GASPS)

00:01:30.006 --> 00:01:31.674
SPEAKER 8: Press freedom
 in the United States

00:01:32.175 --> 00:01:35.678
is starting to look like
many other countries
around the world.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:40.058
That profound crisis
is not going away.

